`collab/data/personas.json` contains **compact persona cards** extracted deterministically
from those role definitions (name / role / worldview / strengths / style, ~240 tokens each).
The upstream long-form role files are **not** vendored in this repository. The license text
of the upstream project is the MIT License; the cards remain available under MIT with the
copyright notices above retained.

To refresh the library:

```bash
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh.git
python scripts/import_agency_personas.py --agency-root ./agency-agents-zh
```

The library is optional: delete `collab/data/personas.json` and persona hints fall back to
the bare persona id.